<!--
  Migrating one entry to another source (phase 4 unit MA): upstream's migrate dialog, its flag labels
  and the duplicate dialog's Migrate button. Upstream's keys carry upstream v0.20.4's English text; the
  failure line is fresh. A file of its own so parallel units never collide on one file (R13).

  Migrating many entries (phase 4 unit MB): Browse's Migrate page and its per-source picker, upstream's
  config screen, its sheet and the migration list, upstream's keys with their dots as underscores and
  upstream's English; the lines after "Saikou's words" have no upstream counterpart.

  The downloads a migration carries over (unit migrate-downloads): the flag's label is upstream's
  downloaded_chapters row; what a Migrate could not move, and its two answers, are Saikou's words.
-->
